#. type: Title #
#: docs/tools/freeanima-docs.md:1 docs/tools/freeanima-docs.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "freeanima_docs ToolSet"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/freeanima-docs.md:8
msgid ""
"On-demand Habitat ToolSet for reading product documentation under `docs/`. "
"Load with:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/tools/freeanima-docs.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "toolset_load([\"freeanima_docs\"])\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/freeanima-docs.md:14
msgid "Then use:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/freeanima-docs.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool                    | Purpose                                                                       |\n"
"| ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `freeanima_docs_list`   | List docs (`path` + `title`). Optional `prefix` (e.g. `cognition/`, `tools/`) |\n"
"| `freeanima_docs_get`    | Full Markdown by relative path (e.g. `product/architecture.md`)               |\n"
"| `freeanima_docs_search` | Keyword AND search over path, title, and body                                 |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/freeanima-docs.md:22
msgid "`README.md` is listed first so agents can orient from the index."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/tools/freeanima-docs.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Path prefixes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/tools/freeanima-docs.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Prefix       | Use when asking…                            |\n"
"| ------------ | ------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `product/`   | What is FreeAnima / data model?             |\n"
"| `cognition/` | How does memory, sleep, self, time work?    |\n"
"| `ui/`        | Visual foundations, components, UX patterns |\n"
"| `aspects/`   | Cross-cutting design planes (data, sync, …) |\n"
"| `modules/`   | What product capabilities exist?            |\n"
"| `tools/`     | Built-in ToolSet boundaries                 |\n"
"| `ops/`       | Install, security, RPC, remote access       |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/tools/freeanima-docs.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Corpus rules"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/tools/freeanima-docs.md:39
msgid "Source: repo `docs/**/*.md` (standalone builds embed the same tree)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/tools/freeanima-docs.md:39
msgid "Skips `docs/.generated/` (translated builds)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/tools/freeanima-docs.md:39
msgid ""
"**Do not** put acceptance checklists, ephemeral QA notes, or IDE-only "
"implementation rules in `docs/` — those belong outside this corpus (e.g. "
"`.agent/rules/`)."
msgstr ""
